-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><b>:</b> </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">본관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">505</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">호 방문하여 담당자 확인</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <b>&nbsp;</b></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;* </b></span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\"><b>보호자 확인</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><b>:</b> </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">보호자 확인 서명 받아야 하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">서명 불가능할 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">담당자 유선확인 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">수기 작성 및 확인 받은 자퇴원을</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> </span></b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">통합정보시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">] </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">– </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">자퇴 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">] </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">메뉴에 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">자퇴원 첨부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">] </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">– </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">저장</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">] - [</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 14pt;\">]</span></b></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">유의</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">사항</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><br></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:28.5pt;text-indent:-28.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학기개시일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">매년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3.1. / 2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">매년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">9.1.) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">기준 만 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">19</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">세 미만일 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">자퇴원 첨부 시 보호자 동의용 인감증명서를 함께 첨부하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">전산신청 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">자퇴원을 증빙자료로 업로드하고 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">] </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">버튼까지 클릭하여야 자퇴 신청이 완료됨</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">자퇴확정일은 최종 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">버튼을 클릭한 날을 기준으로 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">퇴학원 신청 후 처리시한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">접수 후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">일 이내 확정처리 됨</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">관련 문의처</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. 자퇴</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">원 접수 및 승인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">교무처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">054-478-7066</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">국가장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학생성공처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">054-478-7065</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">등록금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">사무국 재무팀 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">054-478-7118</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"23194\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"